</div></section><section id=\\\"play\\\"><div class=\\\"play-heading\\\"><div><p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\" id=\\\"day\\\"></p><h2>Build your best portfolio</h2><p>A portfolio is your chosen group of projects. Tap a card to add or remove it.</p></div><label>Challenge<select id=\\\"mode\\\"><option value=\\\"score\\\">Highest score</option><option value=\\\"keep\\\">Keep the first project</option><option value=\\\"lean\\\">Tighter budgets</option></select></label><button id=\\\"daily\\\">Today\\u2019s puzzle</button></div><div id=\\\"notice\\\" role=\\\"status\\\" aria-live=\\\"polite\\\">Opening the exact challenge\\u2026</div><div class=\\\"portfolio-strip\\\" id=\\\"portfolio-strip\\\" aria-label=\\\"Live selection summary\\\"></div><section class=\\\"selection-scene\\\"><div><p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">YOUR CHOICES, TAKING SHAPE</p><h3>Build a constellation<br>of projects.</h3><p>Each point is one project. Lit points are your selections. Five rings show how much of each budget you use.</p><span class=\\\"scene-status\\\" id=\\\"scene-status\\\"></span></div><div id=\\\"portfolio-scene\\\"></div></section><div class=\\\"game-layout\\\"><section><div id=\\\"cards\\\" class=\\\"cards\\\"></div></section><aside id=\\\"budget-panel\\\"><div class=\\\"scorebox\\\"><span>Your score</span><strong id=\\\"score\\\">0</strong><p id=\\\"personal\\\"></p></div><h3>Your five budgets</h3><div id=\\\"budgets\\\"></div><p id=\\\"fit\\\" role=\\\"status\\\" aria-live=\\\"polite\\\"></p><button class=\\\"primary\\\" id=\\\"reveal\\\">Find what I missed</button><button id=\\\"hint\\\">Give me one hint</button><button id=\\\"clear\\\">Start over</button><p id=\\\"hint-text\\\" aria-live=\\\"polite\\\"></p></aside></div><section id=\\\"answer\\\" hidden aria-live=\\\"polite\\\"></section><div class=\\\"share-row\\\"><button id=\\\"share\\\">Share this challenge</button><button id=\\\"result-card\\\">Save a result card</button><button id=\\\"export\\\">Download exact evidence</button><p id=\\\